        "symptom": "tests/logic/app-server.test.ts 组装最小 runtime（plugins 为空）时启动报 'Service \"@nocobase/app/authorization\" is not registered'",
        "rootCause": "ServiceModuleProvider.boot() 与 ticketFileGuard register() 无条件 resolve authorization/authentication token",
        "resolution": "用 container.has(token) 守卫：业务层与文件守卫在 auth 插件缺席时保持不安装/不启动，但不阻断应用启动；真实运行时这两个插件始终存在，安全语义不变",
        "cost": "约 30 分钟",
        "status": "unknown"
      }
